message: "If you use DealerIQ or its benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "DealerIQ: a dealership intelligence platform"
abstract: >-
  Demand forecasting, inventory optimization, anomaly detection, customer and lead
  analytics, and rule-based alerting layered on a role-based sales-and-inventory
  system of record for automotive dealerships. Includes an operational benchmark of
  classical and intermittent-specific forecasting methods.
type: software
authors:
